				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Add architectural visualization diagram\n\nExtend the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` with a Mermaid graph diagram illustrating the `Common` crate's internal architecture. The diagram maps relationships between Async Traits, the `ActionEffect` system, Environment dependencies, DTOs, `CommonError` handling, Transport layers, and Telemetry flows.\n\nThis visual aid clarifies the contract-first design where traits are defined abstractly and resolved at runtime or compile-time, reinforcing the separation between abstract definitions and downstream implementations like Mountain and Air.",
